===Etymology===
From Hausa-Ajmi هوسا

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈhaʊsə/|lang=en}}
* {{hyphenation|Hau|sa|lang=en}}
* {{audio|En-us-Hausa.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-plural noun}}

A people living in parts of Nigeria, Niger, Chad, Ghana, Cameroun and Sudan.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# The [[Chadic]] language spoken by these people.

